@startuml
title TMFC022: Party Privacy Management -- eTOM/SID ABE Links

class "L2 - Customer Privacy Management\nL2 - Business Partner Privacy Management" as eTOMPrivacyActivities <<eTOM Business Activity>>
class "Party Privacy" as PartyPrivacy <<SID Data Entity>>
class Party <<SID Data Entity>> #line.dashed
class "Party Role" as PartyRole <<SID Data Entity>> #line.dashed

note right of Party
  TMFC028 - Party Management
end note

note right of PartyRole
  TMFC035 - Permission Management
end note

' Party Privacy is the component's own SID ABE: the image draws one path with
' an arrowhead at each end, i.e. both directions hold simultaneously, per the
' legend ("produces" from eTOM activity to SID ABE; "is consumed by" the
' reverse).
eTOMPrivacyActivities --> PartyPrivacy : produces
PartyPrivacy --> eTOMPrivacyActivities : is consumed by

' Party and Party Role are external SID entities (owned by other components,
' TMFC028 and TMFC035 respectively). The image draws only a single arrowhead
' for each, pointing into the eTOM activities box -- consumed by only, no
' reverse "produces" arrow back to either external entity.
Party --> eTOMPrivacyActivities : is consumed by
PartyRole --> eTOMPrivacyActivities : is consumed by

footer TMFC022 - Party Privacy Management
@enduml
